cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its corpus-governance method, please cite it as below."
title: "Blake: A Reproducible, Rights-Bounded William Blake Corpus Workflow"
abstract: >-
  Blake builds a reproducible local corpus workflow for William Blake texts,
  images, metadata, analysis results, visual summaries, exports, and reports,
  with an auditable target ledger and a fail-closed rights gate that separates
  open-source code and aggregate analytics from provider-supplied source files.
